          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لـ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For cash, or a card payment your bank didn't send an SMS or email for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "للدفع كاش، أو لدفعة بالبطاقة ما وصلك عنها رسالة أو إيميل من البنك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "المصدر"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From your next payday, the monthly amount comes off your salary before today's amount is worked out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "من الراتب الجاي، المبلغ الشهري ينحجز من راتبك قبل ما ينحسب مصروف اليوم."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go easy for the rest of today": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "خفّف باقي اليوم"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding two shares? Count them as two members and pick your first turn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "عندك سهمين؟ عدّهم سهمين واختار أول دور لك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بيت"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much you can spend today and still reach payday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "كم تقدر تصرف اليوم وتوصل للراتب براحة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'll finish this later": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بكمّل بعدين"
          }
        }
      }
